f=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Decisions API，搭载Gemini Decision 1模型实现高并发决策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/192786bef6037ee049587bbb3888c62a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月11日正式推出Gemini Decisions API，该接口搭载全新的Gemini Decision 1模型，专为处理是非题、选型题及打分等高频决策场景设计。开发者可上传文本、图像、音频、视频或PDF等多模态材料（最高支持256K Tokens），单次前向计算即可同时处理最多1000个独立问题，并为每个选项输出概率与置信度分数，无需多次API调用。该模型在工具挑选、策略核查、模型路由及上下文质量评估等领域表现突出。性能方面，整段处理延迟控制在150至250毫秒之间。定价策略极具竞争力，输入端价格为每百万Tokens 0.10美元，输出端Tokens完全免费。此外，开发者可手动调节图像与视频分辨率以平衡视觉细节与Token开销。目前，Gemini Decisions API已在Google AI S</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind发布AlphaGenome 2模型，实现细胞级基因变异预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b498c4b0df3b7a4a775e07ada9d03bef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind于11月11日推出AlphaGenome 2，将基因变异预测精度提升至单细胞类型与状态级别。该模型采用条件式架构，通过训练人与小鼠超1.07亿个单细胞图谱，覆盖68种组织。在28类原代免疫细胞的TenK10K测试中，其致病变异识别率达30%，较前代提升近一倍，表达变化预测准确率从23%提升至43%。AlphaGenome 2具备强大的泛化能力，仅需少量单细胞RNA测序数据即可分析未见过的细胞类型，并新增组蛋白修饰、染色质可及性及DNA甲基化预测，支持跨模态推断。目前，该模型已通过AlphaGenome API向非商业研究开放，商业用途需申请私有预览。谷歌强调，该工具仅限科研用途，尚未获得临床或诊断批准，旨在解决复杂疾病基因定位难题。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度正式推出大模型Token交易平台“词元所”，日均调用量超7000亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/71b5cfb7a9d337b39ee10fb3a51d3e01.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度在百度世界2026开幕式上正式发布大模型Token交易平台“词元所”，旨在解决当前模型资源真实性、服务质量及调用稳定性难以验证的行业痛点。该平台核心主打“验真”与“征信”两大能力，通过模型指纹比对、能力测试及性能可用性测试核验资源，并建立模型提供商信用评级机制，提供中立透明的交易服务。百度创始人李彦宏指出，针对市场中部分词元中转站对模型效果与响应速度缺乏监管的问题，词元所通过全链路实时监测与定期抽检拨测，为大模型调用提供基础设施保障。数据显示，词元所上线一个月内已入驻超过100个供应资源，日均调用次数突破5000万，日均调用Token量超过7000亿。该平台的推出标志着大模型产业链正向资源核验、服务评价与信用体系建设等精细化运营阶段迈进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Runway开源27B世界动作模型Praxis-1，登顶机器人榜单并支持商业化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9d67364595409ee9f6582ed6467d4d18.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Runway正式开源270亿参数的世界动作模型Praxis-1，采用Apache 2.0许可，开放模型权重及推理微调代码，全面支持商业用途。该模型采用MoE Diffusion Transformer架构，核心优势在于能同时预测视频与动作。在NVIDIA RoboLab-120基准测试中，Praxis-1以46.2%的成功率位居榜首，超越FLUX3Action等竞品。在迁移泛化测试中，其在Google RT-1机器人上的成功率达80.0%。硬件适配方面，Praxis-1支持从H100、B200数据中心GPU到RTX 5090工作站显卡，乃至Jetson Thor边缘侧芯片的部署。开发者可通过GitHub和Hugging Face获取模型，并支持vLLM-Omni推理及LoRA微调。Runway旨在通过此次开源推</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI第三季度营收突破100亿美元，环比增长近50%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI第三季度营收首次突破100亿美元，较第二季度的67亿美元增长近50%，显示出公司在经历年初增长放缓后的强劲复苏。得益于市场需求回升及新AI模型发布，公司调整后营业利润率从第二季度的-150%收窄至第三季度的-109%。目前OpenAI年收入已达500亿美元，公司正通过收紧定价策略、调整折扣、改进模型以及加大企业级产品和AI Agent投入来推动增长。尽管用户规模超10亿，但OpenAI在企业级市场仍面临Anthropic等竞争对手的挑战。Anthropic第三季度营收达170亿美元，其统计口径包含云合作伙伴销售额，而OpenAI仅统计部分分成。面对Meta、亚马逊、微软及谷歌等巨头的激烈竞争，OpenAI需持续应对算力成本、企业市场份额及模型定价等多重压力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
